# Wazuh SIEM Lab

## Overview

This project documents the deployment of a Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) laboratory using Wazuh.

The environment was built during my cybersecurity internship to gain practical experience in log collection, security monitoring, and threat detection.

---

## Objectives

- Deploy Wazuh SIEM
- Configure Windows endpoint monitoring
- Monitor Linux events
- Learn SIEM architecture
- Build a SOC laboratory

---

## Lab Architecture

Ubuntu Server

- Wazuh Manager
- Wazuh Indexer
- Wazuh Dashboard

Windows Endpoint

- Wazuh Agent

Virtualization Platform

- VMware Workstation

